<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chubb said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chubb said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns upgraded Chubb Corp to buy from attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 45-1/2 Thursday.</p>
</text>
